{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15134","headline":"大礼毕皇帝御丹凤门改元建中大赦 · 李益","name":"大礼毕皇帝御丹凤门改元建中大赦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大明曈曈天地分，六龙负日升天门。\n凤凰飞来衔帝籙，言我万代金皇孙。\n灵鸡鼓舞承天赦，高翔百尺垂朱幡。\n宸居穆清受天历，建中甲子合上元。\n昊穹景命即已至，王事乃可酬乾坤。\n升中告成答玄贶，泥金检玉昭鸿恩。\n云亭之事略可记，七十二君宁独尊。\n小臣欲上封禅表，久而未就归文园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}